  "description": "We’re throwing it back to our roots and paying massive respect to the floor-dancing community with the Sinus—a straight-up flatland weapon. Built on a bombproof, full-chromoly frame with aggressive, Utopia-inspired geometry, this thing is born to spin. We stacked it with elite aftermarket parts from WTP and Éclat, including sticky, flat-specific Mugen tires and the game-changing Hybrid freecoaster hub. Boasting a clean gyro setup, dual brakes, and removable mounts if you want to strip it down, the Sinus blends heritage vibes with modern tech. Whether you’re a veteran dialer or just learning your first megaspin, this machine is ready to unlock your next link.",
